# TaruBot's container settings (#62), in Podman's env-file format: Podman reads each line
# literally, so there are no quotes and no inline comments. ops/ansible/bot.yml writes this file
# from the release's vars/bot.yml and vars/targets/<target>.yml, plus the application and test
# guild the release image reports, and every deploy rewrites it. The bot's unit and tarubot-tool
# both read it.
#
# No secret is here. Each NAME_FILE line names the file where the unit mounts that Podman secret;
# src/config/secrets.ts reads it and removes the one newline the copy gains. tarubot-tool mounts
# the same secrets from these lines.
{% for setting in tb_env %}
{{ setting.name }}={{ setting.value }}
{% endfor %}
{% for file in tb_files %}
{{ file.name }}_FILE=/run/secrets/{{ file.path }}
{% endfor %}
